Matt: also add a tiny routing flow list: primary model -> short-context fallback -> quantized variant -> regional fallback -> 429 degrade mode. Helps ops.
Alex: added one-line ordered list in PR.
Kevin: SDK owners: recommend sample code for now, not a built-in helper. We can reference experimental helper in note.
Priya: agreed. I'll do voice/tone pass and add alt text for the ascii flow.
Sarah: runtime caveat: when suggesting context trimming prefer removing system/non-essential context before user-visible history to avoid surprising behavior.
